{"overview":"یورو، یک شکارچی جوان، در روستایی کوچک در اعماق کوهستان زندگی می‌کند، به شکار حیوانات وحشی می‌رود و زندگی ساده‌ای را با آسا، خواهر دوقلوی کوچکترش، می‌گذراند. زندگی آرام آنها زمانی از هم می‌پاشد که غرش اژدهایی در آسمان می‌پیچد. چه اسراری در روستای آنها نهفته است؟ چه سرنوشتی در انتظار آنهاست؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Yuru, a young hunter, lives in a small village deep in the mountains, hunting wild game and leading a humble life with Asa, his younger twin sister. Their peaceful lives are torn apart when a dragon’s roar echoes across the sky. What secrets lurk within their village? What fate awaits them?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2026,"poster":"/mNqW2jnAogZa0nJ94q1LUum8Hos.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":"/yENL6ewxUKurHNNCY2MN1N1DgH.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小野賢章","role":"Yuru (voice)","photo":"/wUYJ3HIeygHfh4rAqupE4RPoG3W.jpg","en":"Kensho Ono"},{"name":"宮本侑芽","role":"Asa (voice)","photo":"/8PzHX7owawEZKq7Eg9WwcmWYx9s.jpg","en":"Yume Miyamoto"},{"name":"中村悠一","role":"Dera (voice)","photo":"/wb8behVKjBHX9XXrEydvNINCYwH.jpg","en":"Yuichi Nakamura"},{"name":"久野美咲","role":"Gabu-chan (voice)","photo":"/hVtE4gdKaqofYZmXXtlJs4Q9XTL.jpg","en":"Misaki Kuno"},{"name":"本田貴子","role":"Left (voice)","photo":"/LekbnCX6TcabG3EjSOKOgIGrvJ.jpg","en":"Takako Honda"},{"name":"小山力也","role":"Right (voice)","photo":"/hsZm87BORLpzhaycBaWOD5xpjVC.jpg","en":"Rikiya Koyama"},{"name":"島袋美由利","role":"Hana (voice)","photo":"/rjhyRM2hn1deQG1V6cwC8AEEKNT.jpg","en":"Miyuri Shimabukuro"},{"name":"جونیچی سووابه","role":"Jin (voice)","photo":"/4S7c3n3r07A83HvkLrnWZGVhiHg.jpg","en":"Junichi Suwabe"}],"trailer":"NYFJqJGvUHE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/260463/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8Yg